expected_issues.description:
The debug log calls `String.join(",", paths)` before checking `paths.length == 0`. If `paths` were null, this would throw NPE before the safety check. Consider moving the log after the length check for defensive programming.

```suggestion
        if (paths == null || paths.length == 0) {
            return false;
        }
        logger.debug(() -> Strings.format("checking [%s] against [%s]", path, String.join(",", paths)));
```

